  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Static\" Sinatra was once a renowned DJ, spinning vinyl at the hottest underground raves in Old Subchain City. Now, he scavenges for DRIP, using his modified sonic gear to disrupt enemy formations and blast out the few remaining tunes he can remember, a desperate attempt to keep the rave spirit alive in the wasteland.",
    "class": "Sonic Disruptor",
    "name": "\"Static\" Sinatra",
    "personality": "Audacious and rebellious, Static clings to the remnants of a vibrant past. He's fiercely independent, always looking for the next score, and has a knack for finding the right beat - or frequency - to cause chaos. Despite the grim world, he maintains a sardonic wit and a surprising amount of optimism.",
